---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | DesiFit">
  <main class="prose-legal mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 md:px-6">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> September 27, 2026</p>
    <p>
      At DesiFit (<code>desifit.com</code>), we respect your privacy and aim to collect only what is needed to run and
      improve the site.
    </p>
    <h3>Information we collect</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Analytics:</strong> We use Google Analytics (GA4) to understand aggregate traffic (pages viewed, device
        type, approximate geography).
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Hosting logs:</strong> Cloudflare and related infrastructure may collect standard server logs (browser
        type, IP, request time).
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Affiliate cookies:</strong> When you click an Admitad affiliate link, the destination merchant or network
        may place a temporary tracking cookie to attribute a purchase to our referral.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <h3>External links</h3>
    <p>
      Product links leave desifit.com. We are not responsible for third-party privacy practices. Review each merchant’s
      policy when you shop.
    </p>
    <h3>Contact</h3>
    <p>
      Privacy questions: <a href="mailto:hello@desifit.com">hello@desifit.com</a>.
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>
